0 FILE 8841 - Desert Racer - Buggy
0 A Technic desert racing buggy featuring a blue chassis built from long technic bricks and plates, with live axles, bushings, and wheel support and steering assemblies.
0 Name: 8841 - Desert Racer - Buggy
0 Author: Ignacio Fernandez Galvan [jellby]
